title: map_lore
---
Sophia: This place has layers. Whatever happened here wasn't random. Someone — or something — doesn't want the true routes remembered.
-> What do you need from me?
    <<jump map_request>>
===
title: map_request
---
Sophia: If you're heading out anyway — keep your eyes open for old map shards. Stone-pressed ones, pre-corruption. They hold the true routes.
-> I'll look for them.
    <<fire_event sophia_q1_accepted>>
    <<jump grateful>>
-> I'll see what I find.
    <<stop>>
===
title: grateful
---
Sophia: Thank you. Three to five shards — enough to reconstruct the primary route. They're older than anything else down here. You'll know them.
-> Understood.
    <<stop>>
